1
00:00:11,616 --> 00:00:16,824
Hail! Grenada, land of ours,

2
00:00:16,824 --> 00:00:22,475
We pledge ourselves to thee,

3
00:00:22,475 --> 00:00:28,483
Heads, hearts and hands in unity

4
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:34,395
To reach our destiny.

5
00:00:34,395 --> 00:00:40,312
Ever conscious of God,

6
00:00:40,312 --> 00:00:46,206
Being proud of our heritage,

7
00:00:46,206 --> 00:00:52,254
May we with faith and courage

8
00:00:52,254 --> 00:00:58,032
Aspire, build, advance

9
00:00:58,032 --> 00:01:04,216
As one people, one family.

10
00:01:04,216 --> 00:01:12,016
God bless our nation.